          "n": "1",
          "text": "Have you ever loved a woman?"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Do you ever watch television?"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He is just a boy."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He just arrived."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It's just two o'clock."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "This is just what I wanted."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "She talked on for two hours."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "The lights were all on.(All the lights were on.)"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "When do you expect him back?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Back home, he had a family to support."
        },
        {
